# UI (Dice + Radix)

- Use Dice UI File Upload, Tour, Media Player where planned; Radix Tabs, Toast, Dialog.
- FileUpload `accept` must match the active tab (images / videos / audio only).
- Long compares: Dialog + indeterminate circular progress; one compare at a time (mutex).
- Diffs/errors/info: Radix Toast explaining field and why it differs.
- Tour only on first visit (`localStorage` flag).
- Theme: light / dark / system via navbar control.
